        <mxCell id="c131" value="&lt;i&gt;Columns A, C and H to K are hidden. The Table is filtered to Finished Good and sorted by ItemGroup, then MarginPct from largest to smallest, and the window is scrolled to where Furniture ends and Lighting begins. 27 finished goods are below the target in all: the rule fills columns A to L, so the scale stays visible in MarginPct (outlined). The scale is drawn in three steps. Blue row numbers mark a filtered Table.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="406" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
